    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's just... it feels like there's no point in fighting it all. i've spent my whole life building things, being useful, and now i'm just a burden to the doctors and my neighbors. watching myself fade away bit by bit feels so much more cruel than just being done with it. it feels like i've lost all my agency.",
